## SPDX Note

The `license` field in package.json is set to `"SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE"`
rather than an SPDX expression. The PolyForm Internal Use License 1.0.0 has
no SPDX identifier, so an `OR` expression combining it with the Noncommercial
license would not be a valid SPDX license expression.

